  "Shop statistics": "Imibare y’iduka",
  "A summary view for the shop owner.": "Incamake y’ibikorwa ku nyiri iduka.",
  "People and shops": "Abantu n’amaduka",
  "Add your team, serve your customers and run more than one shop.": "Ongeramo itsinda ryawe, ukorere abakiliya bawe kandi ucunge amaduka arenze rimwe.",
  "Staff accounts": "Konti z’abakozi",
  "Give each person a role and the right access.": "Haha buri muntu inshingano n’uburenganzira bukwiye.",
  "Customers": "Abakiliya",
  "Keep a customer list for repeat sales.": "Bika urutonde rw’abakiliya ku igurisha rikurikira.",
