  "Your language": "Ururimi rwawe",
  "Switch the interface language at any time.": "Hindura ururimi rw’urubuga igihe icyo ari cyo cyose.",
  "Shop admin": "Umuyobozi w’iduka",
  "Runs the shop: products, categories, suppliers, customers, staff, expenses and statistics.": "Ayobora iduka: ibicuruzwa, ibyiciro, abatanga ibicuruzwa, abakiliya, abakozi, amafaranga yakoreshejwe n’imibare.",
  "Can edit and delete records others can only view.": "Ashobora guhindura no gusiba inyandiko abandi bashobora kureba gusa.",
  "Seller": "Umucuruzi",
  "Works the counter: sales, purchases, bulk imports and approving waiter orders.": "Akorera ku meza: igurisha, ibyaguzwe, kwinjiza byinshi no kwemeza commande z’abaserivisi.",
  "Can view products and expenses.": "Ashobora kureba ibicuruzwa n’amafaranga yakoreshejwe.",
  "Waiter": "Umuserivisi",
  "Takes orders at the table from a dashboard built for that one job.": "Afata commande ku meza akoresheje ikibaho cyagenewe uwo murimo gusa.",
  "Manager": "Umuyobozi",
  "Oversees day-to-day work from a manager dashboard.": "Akurikirana imirimo ya buri munsi akoresheje ikibaho cy’umuyobozi.",
  "Accountant": "Umucungamari",
  "Follows the money from a finance dashboard and the full set of reports.": "Akurikirana amafaranga akoresheje ikibaho cy’imari na raporo zose.",
  "System admin": "Umuyobozi wa sisitemu",
  "Approves or rejects new shops, manages users and sets platform settings.": "Yemeza cyangwa yanga amaduka mashya, acunga abakoresha kandi agena ibigenewe urubuga.",
