  "A system admin reviews your shop. You see its status while you wait.": "Umuyobozi wa sisitemu asuzuma iduka ryawe. Ubona imiterere yaryo mu gihe utegereje.",
  "Set up": "Tegura",
  "Add products, suppliers, customers and your staff.": "Ongeramo ibicuruzwa, abatanga ibicuruzwa, abakiliya n’abakozi bawe.",
  "Trade": "Curuza",
  "Sell, buy and record expenses as the day goes.": "Gurisha, gura kandi wandike amafaranga akoreshwa umunsi ugenda.",
  "Read the reports": "Soma raporo",
  "Check profit and loss, then export it as PDF, Excel or CSV.": "Reba inyungu n’igihombo, hanyuma ubisohore muri PDF, Excel cyangwa CSV.",
  "Privacy": "Ibanga",
  "We collect only what the app needs to work: your account details, your shop details, and the records you enter, such as sales, purchases, expenses, products, customers and staff.": "Dukusanya gusa ibyo porogaramu ikeneye ngo ikore: amakuru ya konti yawe n’ay’iduka ryawe, hamwe n’inyandiko winjiza nk’igurisha, ibyaguzwe, amafaranga yakoreshejwe, ibicuruzwa, abakiliya n’abakozi.",
  "We do not sell your data.": "Ntitugurisha amakuru yawe.",
  "The records of your shop are visible only to people you give access to, and to system admins who support the platform.": "Inyandiko z’iduka ryawe zibonwa gusa n’abo uhaye uburenganzira, hamwe n’abayobozi ba sisitemu baha urubuga ubufasha.",
  "You can ask us to correct or delete your account data at any time.": "Ushobora kudusaba gukosora cyangwa gusiba amakuru ya konti yawe igihe icyo ari cyo cyose.",
  "Your data and security": "Amakuru yawe n’umutekano",
  "Each shop keeps its records separate from other shops. Access is controlled by role, and every person signs in with their own account.": "Buri duka rigumana inyandiko zaryo zitandukanye n’iz’andi maduka. Uburenganzira bugenwa n’inshingano, kandi buri muntu yinjira akoresheje konti ye bwite.",
  "Use a strong password and do not share it.": "Koresha ijambobanga rikomeye kandi ntuhe abandi.",
  "Remove staff accounts when someone leaves.": "Siba konti z’abakozi iyo umuntu agiye.",
  "Exports (PDF, Excel, CSV) are copies of your data. Keep them safe.": "Ibisohorwa (PDF, Excel, CSV) ni kopi z’amakuru yawe. Ubibike neza.",
  "Roles and access": "Inshingano n’uburenganzira",
  "Shop admins decide who works in their shop and what role each person has. A role limits what someone can see and change. Only shop admins can edit or delete most records.": "Abayobozi b’amaduka bagena abakorera mu iduka ryabo n’inshingano za buri muntu. Inshingano igabanya ibyo umuntu ashobora kureba no guhindura. Abayobozi b’amaduka gusa bashobora guhindura cyangwa gusiba inyandiko nyinshi.",
  "Shop approval": "Kwemeza amaduka",
  "New shops are reviewed by a system admin before they can trade on the platform. We may reject or suspend a shop that gives false information or breaks these terms.": "Amaduka mashya asuzumwa n’umuyobozi wa sisitemu mbere yo gukorera ku rubuga. Dushobora kwanga cyangwa guhagarika iduka ritanga amakuru y’ibinyoma cyangwa rirengera aya mabwiriza.",
  "Terms of use": "Amabwiriza yo gukoresha",
  "Use the app only for lawful business.": "Koresha porogaramu mu bucuruzi bwemewe n’amategeko gusa.",
  "You are responsible for the accuracy of the records you enter.": "Ni wowe ushinzwe ukuri kw’inyandiko winjiza.",
  "Do not try to access the data of another shop or break the security of the app.": "Ntugerageze kugera ku makuru y’irindi duka cyangwa kurenga umutekano wa porogaramu.",
  "We may update the app and these terms. We will publish changes on this page.": "Dushobora kuvugurura porogaramu n’aya mabwiriza. Impinduka tuzazishyira kuri uru rupapuro.",
