  "Sell at the till, record what you buy and spend, and see profit and loss by day, week, month or year. Your sellers, waiters, managers and accountants each get the screens they need and nothing more.": "Gurisha ku meza, wandike ibyo uguze n’ibyo ukoresha, urebe inyungu n’igihombo ku munsi, icyumweru, ukwezi cyangwa umwaka. Abacuruzi, abaserivisi, abayobozi n’abacungamari bawe buri wese abona gusa ibyo akeneye.",
