  "Everything a shop does in a day, in one place.": "Ibyo iduka rikora byose mu munsi, ahantu hamwe.",
  "From the first sale in the morning to the profit and loss report at night.": "Kuva ku igurisha rya mbere mu gitondo kugeza kuri raporo y’inyungu n’igihombo nijoro.",
  "Everyone sees the screens they need.": "Buri wese abona ibyo akeneye.",
  "Access is set by role, so a waiter never ends up in the books and an accountant never ends up at the till.": "Uburenganzira bugenwa n’inshingano, bityo umuserivisi ntagera mu mibare y’imari kandi umucungamari ntagera ku meza y’igurisha.",
  "From sign-up to first report.": "Kuva kwiyandikisha kugeza kuri raporo ya mbere.",
  "Built for the people who actually run shops.": "Yakozwe ku bantu bacunga amaduka by’ukuri.",
  ":app started with a simple question: why does a small shop need three notebooks, a calculator and a spreadsheet to know whether it made money today?": ":app yatangiye kubera ikibazo cyoroshye: kuki iduka rito rikenera amakayi atatu, kalkulatrisi n’urupapuro rw’imbonerahamwe kugira ngo rimenye niba ryungutse uyu munsi?",
  "So we put selling, buying, spending and reporting in one app. Owners get a clear picture of every shop. Staff get a short list of screens that match their job. Nobody has to learn accounting to use it.": "Ni cyo cyatumye dushyira igurisha, ibyaguzwe, amafaranga akoreshwa na raporo muri porogaramu imwe. Ba nyir’amaduka babona neza uko buri duka rihagaze. Abakozi babona gusa ibijyanye n’akazi kabo. Nta wukeneye kwiga ibaruramari ngo ayikoreshe.",
  "It works for a single counter, a restaurant with waiters, or an owner with several locations, because each shop keeps its own records under one login.": "Ikora ku meza y’igurisha rimwe, kuri resitora ifite abaserivisi, cyangwa kuri nyir’amaduka menshi, kuko buri duka rigumana inyandiko zaryo munsi y’uburyo bumwe bwo kwinjira.",
  "Questions before you sign up?": "Ufite ibibazo mbere yo kwiyandikisha?",
